* "American Lead C+" power amp (the 100 W board of the Mark IIC+ drawing): a long-tailed ECC83 phase inverter whose cathodes sit on the feedback network
* (R67 / R64 / R63 / R62: the tail is the feedback path to ground), four 6L6GC as two parallel pairs (2.2k grid stoppers, 470 R screen resistors from the
* B supply, grids at the bias supply through 220k each), the output transformer with the 8 and 4 ohm taps, and the HT supply with its
* choke and the three RC filters (B, C, D). The negative feedback is taken from the 8 ohm tap through the presence rheostat, R60 and R61 / C61.
* Not modelled: the Simul-Class / Class A switch and its diodes (the 100 W wiring, cathodes grounded), the direct output.

S VAUDIO pin 50k 0
S VHT a 1 470
S VBIAS bias 100 -52

* Phase inverter V5: signal in through C66 on V5A's grid.
C C66 pin ga 0.1u
R R65 ga j 100k
R R67 j kk 470
R R64 n1 j 22k
R R66 j gb 150k
C C65 n2 gb 0.1u
R R62 n2 0 3.3k
C C64 n2 0 0.047u
R R63 n1 n2 1.5k
T V5A ga pa kk 12AX7
T V5B gb pb kk 12AX7
R R68 c pa 82.5k
R R69 c pb 90.9k
C C68 pb c 120p
C C70 pa dt 0.1u
C C71 pb db 0.1u

* Presence: the 250k rheostat in the feedback path (a complementary pair: VRPS is the series part, VRPD an unused dummy), then R60 and R61 / C61 into the feedback node.
R VRPD pdum 0 100k
R VRPS t8 pp 1k
R R60 pp pq 1.5k
R R61 pq n1 56k
C C61 pq n1 0.0047u

* Power-tube grids: the bias supply through R70 / R71 (220k) and 47u.
R R70 dt bias 220k
R R71 bias db 220k
C C97 bias 0 47u

* 6L6GC pairs (V9 + V6 on the first phase, V7 + V8 on the second): grid stoppers, screens from B.
R R74_9 dt g45 2.2k/2
R R75_8 db g67 2.2k/2
P V4 g45 pt s45 0 6L6GCDS 2
P V5 g67 pbm s67 0 6L6GCDS 2
R R79_9 sb s45 470/2
R R80_8 sb s67 470/2

* Output transformer (100 W, 4 x 6L6): plate-to-plate 2.8k, 3.5 H per primary half; windings are primary halves, then the 8 ohm secondary
* with its 4 ohm tap at 0.7071 of the turns from the grounded end.
R DCR_PT pt npt 40
R DCR_PB pbm npb 40
.param n8 = 2*1/sqrt(2800/8)
.xfmr OT L=3.5 SAT=4.7
  W npt a 1 pri
  W a npb 1 pri
  W t8 t4 0.2929*n8 sec
  W t4 0 0.7071*n8 sec
  K pri pri 0.9998
  K pri sec 0.9993
  K sec sec 0.9998
.end
R RLOAD t8 0 8

* HT supply: A (reservoir, 110u) -> choke (100) -> B (screens, C84) -> R84 -> C (V5 plates) -> R85 -> D (the preamp's rail X).
R T3 a sb 100
C C84 sb 0 30u
R R84 sb c 5.6k
C C85 c 0 30u
R R85 c x 5.6k
C C86 x 0 30u
R RPREAMP x 0 70k
